{"games":[{"id":15694887572,"name":"[CHURCH] Anomaly Watch","desc":"Anomaly Watch is a horror game inspired by the Mandela Catalogue and the I'm On Observation Duty games. In Anomaly Watch you are sent to explore a rural house where unexplainable events happen, objects go missing, become distorted, and strange humanoids appear. Your job is to recognize and report unexplainable events and most importantly, report unrecognizable creatures and intruders. All in all survive until 6 am. Good Luck!\n\nHouse Keybinds:\nPC: Equip Tablet - R\nMobile: Equip Tablet - Button on side of the screen.\n\nOffice Keybinds:\nFlashlight: F or Gamepad B\nSprint: Left Shift or Gamepad R1\nExiting the reporter: Jump\n\nHorror outside human comprehension.\nThank you for playing Anomaly Watch\n\nDeveloper: punitto\nIcon art: Jslay0_0\n\nv.101\n-new map (CHURCH)\n-leaderboards\n-win counts\n-hardmode","path":"/game/15694887572-church-anomaly-watch","slug":"15694887572-church-anomaly-watch","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/cb6f1b63f2ca78d2264d148ebd7a0c31e8f8a3ca47acee4b33403b9176c1e1ad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f6d2dd1e5595d581cac75844c00c2890/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":38,"visitor":35132713,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-03T03:09:56.533Z","creator":{"name":"Bachibo","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":118510517937460,"name":"amazing 📦","desc":"","path":"/game/118510517937460-amazing","slug":"118510517937460-amazing","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/ada9e10ee106eb579a06027bae5b760cd9fbcdfdfa51548c5dda57b2516f68c7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5698f4e6b8418001f95e2e9f62abdced/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":38,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":121208024528653,"name":"Connect the Words 💬","desc":"","path":"/game/1212080245