ircuits\n• Online multiplayer racing — challenge players anytime\n• Official Karting League — join teams and compete\n• Realistic grip system (wet tracks & cold tyres)\n• Kart tuning & tyre change system\n\n🏎️ GAMEPLAY\nKF1 Karting delivers an immersive racing experience where skill and consistency matter. Adapt to track conditions, fine-tune your kart, and outpace your rivals.\n\n⚠️ NOTICE\n• Game is in BETA — expect bugs and glitches\n• Requires moderate/high PC performance (lower graphics if needed)\n\n*Not affiliated with the real KF1 Karting company*","path":"/game/8496163103-beta-kf1-karting","slug":"8496163103-beta-kf1-karting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/759f11f6c10ae52ba0f0298e6ae680919a6cd51a77b29b9e3c66b9e64b9c77bf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7462aa523a0b48633e4e6a249776b288/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":38,"visitor":43937342,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-13T06:13:55.481Z","creator":{"name":"KF1 Karting | Official Karting League","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":82606552651811,"name":"[⚠️] Steal a Underground Artist","desc":"(This game is still experimental, there can be bugs)\n\nTutorial:\n🎤 Buy an Artist\n🚨 Steal underground Artists\n🤑 Earn cash\n⏪ Rebirth\n⭐ Please consider liking and favoriting the game for more frequent updates.\n\n🙏 This game uses the \"Purse\" Backpack System, created by @WinnersTakesAll. All credits go to them!\n\nThank you for playing 🐍","path":"/game/82606552651811-steal-a-underground-artist","slug":"82606552651811-steal-a-underground-artist","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/65fc669b383639a9ea56f0966880e2bbf503141fadd9b29522935de4da3bbd55.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a3c321fafd58c8ac39a11a3c810c50dc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":38,"visitor":1044919,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-25T22:40:04.653Z","creator":{"name":"Underground Experiences","type":"Group"},"script":{"c